    {
      "title": "Write a Setpoint",
      "desc": "Function 6: one register",
      "detail": "The engineer raises the tank’s level setpoint from 4.50 m to 5.00 m: function 6, write single register, register 3, value 500. The PLC answers by repeating the request, which means done. From now on its program keeps the tank fuller.",
