    {
      "title": "Start a Pump",
      "desc": "Function 5: a coil",
      "detail": "Coils are single on/off outputs. Function 5 writes one: coil 0, pump 2, value 0xFF00, which means on. The PLC switches the pump on and echoes the request. In a real plant the PLC’s own program usually decides this, with safety interlocks.",
      "facts": [
