    {
      "title": "An Exception",
      "desc": "No such register",
      "detail": "A request for registers that don’t exist, here 100 and 101, gets an exception: the function code with its top bit set (3 + 128 = 131) and exception code 2, illegal data address. Other codes say the function isn’t supported or the device is busy.",
